@startuml phase5-ivi-callflow
' Phase 5 call flow: an R4 datagram becomes a rendered God View (R4, R16, R17).
' Companion of phase5-ivi-hld.md. Fidelity = what Phase 5 actually builds:
' the producer is the R4 simulator; Phase 6 swaps it for the real ADA ECU
' without changing anything to its right.

title R4 warning: simulator/ADA -> UDP -> observer -> serializer -> view-model -> God View

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam shadowing false

participant "R4 Simulator\n(ADA node, Phase 6: real ADA)" as SIM
participant "R4ListenerService\n(:app, foreground)" as SVC
participant "JdkDatagramSource\n(:observer)" as SRC
participant "R4SocketObserver\n(:observer)" as OBS
participant "R4Deserializer\n(:serializer)" as DEC
participant "R4Repository\n(:app data)" as REPO
participant "WarningViewModel\n(:app ui logic)" as WVM
participant "MainViewModel\n(:app ui logic)" as MVM
participant "MainScreen +\nCanvasWarningView (:app ui)" as UI

== Startup ==

SVC -> SVC : startForeground(notification)
SVC -> OBS : start(appScope)
OBS -> SRC : bind(0.0.0.0, config.port)
SRC --> OBS : bound
OBS -> OBS : linkState = Bound
REPO -> OBS : collect(events) on appScope
UI -> MVM : collectAsState(currentMode)
UI -> WVM : collectAsState(uiWarningState)

== Nominal warning (R17 acceptance) ==

SIM -> SRC : UDP datagram\n{"schemaVersion":1,"type":"warning",...}
note right of SIM
  Payload built from the frozen
  contracts/samples/r4-warning.json,
  geometry/risk overwritten per scenario
end note

SRC -> SRC : packet.setLength(buffer.size)\nbefore every receive()
SRC --> OBS : Received(buffer, offset, length)
OBS -> OBS : length == buffer.size ?\n-> log truncation-suspect
OBS -> DEC : decode(buffer, offset, length)
DEC -> DEC : slice offset..offset+length\nstrip BOM + whitespace, UTF-8
DEC -> DEC : R4Json.decodeFromString(R4Message.serializer())
DEC --> OBS : Decoded(R4WarningEvent, schemaVersionAhead=false)
OBS -> OBS : log [RX] type=warning bytes=452\nwarningType=... risk=... cSource=v2x_relayed
OBS -> REPO : emit R4Event.Message  (SharedFlow, DROP_OLDEST)
REPO -> REPO : lastWarning = event
REPO -> WVM : warningEvents
WVM -> WVM : classify(warningType) -> presentation\n(unknown -> generic, value preserved)
WVM -> WVM : uiWarningState = Active(scene, riskState)\narm timeout(WARNING_TIMEOUT_MS)
WVM -> MVM : Active
MVM -> MVM : previousMode = currentMode\ncurrentMode = WarningView
MVM --> UI : recompose (AnimatedContent)
UI -> UI : IviWarningViewSeam.Render(scene, riskState)
UI -> UI : SceneCoordinateMapper.mapScene(scale from config)
UI -> UI : source guard: snapshot.source == v2x_relayed ?\nghost C : yellow [?] + log ERROR

== Malformed / unknown-type datagram (receive loop survives) ==

SIM -> SRC : truncated or non-JSON bytes
SRC --> OBS : Received(...)
OBS -> DEC : decode(...)
DEC --> OBS : Failed(MALFORMED, detail, bounded preview)
OBS -> OBS : log [DROP] reason=malformed preview="..."
OBS -> REPO : emit R4Event.Dropped
note right of OBS : loop continues; no throw crosses the loop
REPO -> MVM : link/status counters (bottom status bar only)

== Socket error -> rebind with back-off ==

SRC --> OBS : SocketException
OBS -> OBS : linkState = Rebinding\ndelay = min(delay * 2, retryMaxMs)
OBS -> SRC : close(); bind(...) retry
SRC --> OBS : bound
OBS -> OBS : linkState = Bound; reset back-off

== No further message -> timeout -> restore (R16) ==

WVM -> WVM : timeout elapsed, no new warning
WVM -> WVM : uiWarningState = Idle
WVM -> MVM : Idle
MVM -> MVM : userOverrodeDuringWarning ?\nkeep user's mode : restore previousMode
MVM --> UI : recompose

== Dev injector (I3, debug build only) ==

actor "adb broadcast\nDEV_INJECT" as ADB
ADB -> REPO : DevInjectorReceiver decodes a bundled sample\nand emits the same R4Event.Message
note right of ADB
  Joins downstream of the socket, upstream of
  everything else -> same path as a real datagram.
  Absent from the release build by source set.
end note

@enduml
